"id": "790462812150344", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031458_790462815483677_5380930595172148371_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WNmN43_At5YQ7kNvwHoegfI&_nc_oc=Adq-ofM1Bj_KKUXd4_ajzDleUDp_3fE7kvbG8LkOCy2TRzt17fzjjIVuq4gcSXH-lD8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7y8QHlenpmHYG4iO4GkVl0Q9L5PBn861XDVMXrG5ehGQ&oe=6A12EB51"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot2.png", "id": "850077762573200", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031634_850077769239866_7313417490599216593_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H32zbjln7woQ7kNvwHKFZO7&_nc_oc=Adr1m-dNiSZ0w4yNK22m-cKpEIAYf3p88TZbPNf9K1GtADt7zznY3uaalvoJZyrGizY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af46m1ISos1S3uwWg6Bum9t-gx_eFDoILUHF0wNB-kAKoQ&oe=6A131C6B"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot3.png", "id": "1514223109014213", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001667_1514223119014212_7927654477935769634_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9WG-h_TzuawQ7kNvwE3b5C4&_nc_oc=Ado9WJBpTue8KSl2GXLnngG_9Ot-ELkDpxQlswnEu9j3vjBJNp_x-cZ9TxXzPTaGZwY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5qy0YcbPI5TG9pljlIAMwGI6OMEv2GzQxl9QLZoiY6mA&oe=6A12F6E7"}, {"file_name": "Screenshot4.png", "id": "1118439258797246", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001667_1118439262130579_1516651612606432838_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=EOCasvxvf1UQ7kNvwGPgS5i&_nc_oc=Adr7KTnYtoC7IwtYTz4UG7pREuE9bMi-hBW2VEZSoMMgGx7JmJ643s-b-1qzrV8uNIs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4NQGAm0ru0AMoKe9wsdsO2mw9mhvK2-IUBAgKZS4F45w&oe=6A131AAA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverLandscape.png", "id": "3147257625535224", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974593_3147257628868557_5914689202831265680_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-zZegUea_y8Q7kNvwEF68km&_nc_oc=AdqMEnx17dF-EukHnh0d90kcNoLSkwkDgk1wFaoAVnML61KSDvpLRXLA1Ovh2y0HDes&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6A4vDd8Vs5Yf4_1PUDN3XS1iftcTz0eZmNa5C5RwUj9g&oe=6A12F321"}, "display_name": "3D scan of a ruin in a forest", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Move like a pedestrian in a ruin surrounded by a forest, reconstructed from videos taken by a helmet-held 360 camera, whose trajectory is about 400m long.\n\nRight controller:\n- Rotate on the left or right by using the joystick\n- Update the vertical offset (up or down) by using the joystick\n- Choose a location and teleport to it by using the virtual laser pointer\n- Teleport by using the index trigger only if the laser is green (not red)\n\nLeft controller:\n- Move continuously by using the joystick\n- Switch pannel and map by using the grip/hand trigger\n- If both map and pannel are disabled, switch between rendering modes (texturing or normal colors) by pressing the index trigger\n- The map shows the cloud of mesh vertices and the user location\n- If the pannel is enabled, switch between constrained and unconstrained motions by pressing the index trigger\n- The constrained motion controls your height above the ground\n- The pannel shows information about the 3D model and the selected motion.\n", "short_description": "Move continuously like a pedestrian in a ruin surrounded by a forest, which was computed by photogrammetry from a cubemap video (4096x1344x2) taken by a helmet-held 360 camera (Gopro Max) and by walking about 400 meters."}]}, "developer_name": "Maxime Lhuillier", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/PrivacyPolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Unity 2019.4", "support_website_url": "http://maxime.lhuillier.free.fr/", "website_url": "https://maximelhuillier.fr/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_